            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
              For most homes, we recommend professional wood floor cleaning every 12-18 months to maintain their appearance and protect the finish. Homes with pets, children, or high foot traffic may benefit from cleaning every 6-9 months. Regular professional cleaning extends the life of your floors significantly.
            </p>
