            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
              Our cleaning process effectively removes surface dirt, grime, and many light stains, restoring the floor's natural shine. For deep scratches, gouges, or stains that have penetrated the finish, we offer refinishing services. We'll assess your floors and recommend the best solution during your estimate.
            </p>
          </div>

