            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
              Our quick-dry process minimizes downtime significantly. Most wood floors are dry and safe to walk on within 1-2 hours. We use controlled moisture application to clean effectively without saturating the wood—protecting against warping or finish damage.
            </p>
          </div>

